{"id":642,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"They say this wielder of electricity has waged war with its nemesis, Tornadus, since time immemorial. The lightning bolts it hurls pierce the very earth and enrich the soil."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of lightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off lightning bolts."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"Countless charred remains mar the landscape of places through which Thundurus has passed."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Prankster","hidden":false,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's status moves."},{"name":"Defiant","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon has any stat lowered by an opposing Pokémon, its Attack stat will be boosted sharply."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":0,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":90,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":642,"name":"Thundurus","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,84],[1,310],[5,43],[10,207],[15,44],[20,351],[25,97],[30,268],[35,521],[40,242],[45,435],[50,253],[55,359],[60,240],[65,87],[70,37],[75,847]],"machine":[512,97,34,280,339,268,451,242,399,598,604,486,527,203,263,430,374,19,411,492,416,447,63,282,808,417,182,94,240,156,184,214,188,482,479,684,555,164,241,916,36,269,851,168,87,9,86,85,369,253,521,311,528,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-33","name":"Thundurus","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Rare","number":"33","artist":"hncl","img":"zsv10pt5/33"},{"id":"sv4pt5-139","name":"Thundurus","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Rare","number":"139","artist":"Shin Nagasawa","img":"sv4pt5/139"},{"id":"sv3-70","name":"Thundurus","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rar